      "content": "look i get that u have to say that but i'm just looking for a second opinion on the science itself. im reading online that vitamin c is a huge antioxidant and helps with inflammation which is what causes the stone discomfort in the first place. if i take the 2500mg but make sure i'm also taking extra magnesium and staying super hydrated, isn't that basically just neutralizing the risk? i just want to know if it's scientifically sound to use it as a detox tool.",
